# Mercy Land — environment variables
# Copy to .env.local for local dev (.env.local is gitignored via *.local).
# For production, set these in the Render dashboard for the `mercyland` static site.

# Chat World gating. Set to 'false' to hide chat-world entry objects from the void.
VITE_CHAT_WORLD_ENABLED=true

# Analytics (specs/analytics.md) — Umami cloud. Both values come from the Umami dashboard's
# tracking snippet. LEAVE THESE UNSET LOCALLY: with no script loaded, src/lib/analytics.ts logs
# events to the console instead of sending them, which is how you verify instrumentation without
# polluting production numbers.
# VITE_UMAMI_SRC=https://cloud.umami.is/script.js
# VITE_UMAMI_ID=
